":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji004-027","subject_person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"nek_dsn_nih","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p025","quote":"康王卒，子昭王瑕立","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本文明示的親屬主張；不是獨立確證，不由繼位推導血緣。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji004-028","subject_person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p025","quote":"立昭王子滿，是為穆王","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本文明示的親屬主張；不是獨立確證，不由繼位推導血緣。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji032-035","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","surfaces":["昭王"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou","c-shiji-032-qi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p025","quote":"康王卒，子昭王瑕立。昭王之時，王道微缺。昭王南巡狩不返，卒於江上。其卒不赴告，諱之也。立昭王子滿，是為穆王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p039","quote":"三十年春，齊桓公率諸侯伐蔡，蔡潰。遂伐楚。楚成王興師問曰：「何故涉吾地？」管仲對曰：「昔召康公命我先君太公曰：『五侯九伯，若實征之，以夾輔周室。』賜我先君履，東至海，西至河，南至穆陵，北至無棣。楚貢包茅不入，王祭不具，是以來責。昭王南征不復，是以來問。」楚王曰：「貢之不入，有之，寡人罪也，敢不共乎！昭王之出不復，君其問之水濱。」齊師進次于陘。夏，楚王使屈完將兵捍齊，齊師退次召陵。桓公矜屈完以其眾。屈完曰：「君以道則可；若不，則楚方城以為城，江、漢以為溝，君安能進乎？」乃與屈完盟而去。過陳，陳袁濤涂詐齊，令出東方，覺。秋，齊伐陳。是歲，晉殺太子申生。"}],"rationale":"按本篇小白立桓公、管仲任政、葵丘盟會及齊君／母親的明示敘事相接暫定；魯與齊的同號君主、同氏女性分開，不作全庫字串合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p025","text":"康王卒，子昭王瑕立。昭王之時，王道微缺。昭王南巡狩不返，卒於江上。其卒不赴告，諱之也。立昭王子滿，是為穆王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"康王","kind":"person","person_id":"nek_dsn_nih","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"昭王瑕","kind":"person","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"voy_rog_jbw","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"滿","kind":"person","person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同段明示人物與敘事暫定短稱，不作其他段落或其他時代的自動識別。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m025-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p039","text":"三十年春，齊桓公率諸侯伐蔡，蔡潰。遂伐楚。楚成王興師問曰：「何故涉吾地？」管仲對曰：「昔召康公命我先君太公曰：『五侯九伯，若實征之，以夾輔周室。』賜我先君履，東至海，西至河，南至穆陵，北至無棣。楚貢包茅不入，王祭不具，是以來責。昭王南征不復，是以來問。」楚王曰：「貢之不入，有之，寡人罪也，敢不共乎！昭王之出不復，君其問之水濱。」齊師進次于陘。夏，楚王使屈完將兵捍齊，齊師退次召陵。桓公矜屈完以其眾。屈完曰：「君以道則可；若不，則楚方城以為城，江、漢以為溝，君安能進乎？」乃與屈完盟而去。過陳，陳袁濤涂詐齊，令出東方，覺。秋，齊伐陳。是歲，晉殺太子申生。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m039-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m039-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"楚成王","kind":"person","person_id":"2d3_fsd_1dh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m039-0037","start":37,"end